  },
  "priority_recommendations": [
    "1. PERF-002 (PerimeterGenerator nesting) — Highest ROI fix. Replace O(n^2) containment with spatial index and swap-and-pop deletion.",
    "2. PERF-003 (TreeSupport merge) — Already documented O(n^2); reduce leaf bucket sizes or add spatial pre-filtering.",
    "3. PERF-004 (GCode string concat) — Pre-allocate output string; estimate ~100 bytes per extrusion point × point count.",
    "4. PERF-010/011 (Retract spatial queries) — Build EdgeGrid/AABB index per layer as noted in existing FIXME comments.",
    "5. PERF-001 (autospeed_volumetric_limit) — Cache config lookups outside inner loop; straightforward fix.",
    "6. PERF-007 (TriangleMeshSlicer mutex) — Switch to thread-local accumulation with merge reduction."
  ]
}
